WEBVTT

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:30.306
Aren't I good?

00:05:30.744 --> 00:05:32.560
Aren't I special somehow?

00:05:33.144 --> 00:05:35.946
I have committed zero homicides

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.135
to date.

00:05:37.159 --> 00:05:39.658
(Laughter)

00:05:39.682 --> 00:05:41.618
(Applause)

00:05:41.642 --> 00:05:43.425
So why is this happening to me?

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.832
I wanted God to make me good

00:05:46.856 --> 00:05:50.816
and to reward my faith with just a few
shining awards along the way.

00:05:51.377 --> 00:05:53.631
OK, like, a lot of shining awards.

00:05:53.655 --> 00:05:54.663
(Laughter)

00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:57.494
I believed that hardships
were only detours

00:05:57.518 --> 00:06:01.079
on what I was certain would be
my long, long life.